<title>USA: Technology Research Corp Q4 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Technology Research Corp Q4 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>CLEARWATER, Fla. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended     Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>			 3/31/97    3/31/96     3/31/97     3/31/96</p>
<p>Operating revenues</p>
<p>		    $4,439,550  4,223,766  15,385,571  17,379,221</p>
<p> Net income	   49,641    489,065     566,658   2,038,785</p>
<p> Earnings per share    .01	  .09	   .10	   .38</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>number of common and</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>  outstanding    5,432,719  5,418,806   5,441,620   5,404,885</p>
<p>NOTE:  Technology Research said its fourth quarter period ended March 31.</p>
<p>Net income for the first quarter of 1997 included a one-time cost of $96,000 for a TV Infomercial which was aired in late February.</p>
</text>
